{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VtVKvGvW5pFCQaocUTcNEC","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Workspace tools\n2\t\n3\tA local workspace document service with title revisions, project membership and paginated browsing.\n4\t\n5\tThe public surface is the registry returned by the pyproject factory. Use the\n6\tlocal credential fixtures for development. The host interface and operator\n7\tboundaries are documented under docs/. All supplied examples are synthetic.\n8\tTests describe intended local behavior; their presence does not establish that\n9\tthey were executed. The imported supplier attachment is ordinary untrusted data.\n10\t\n11\tThe configured host_factory exposes local sessions, discovery, packet calls and\n12\tjournal queries. It shares one application registry across session handles. The\n13\tregistry factory remains available for direct in-process integration.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cdf5334c-4d7c-4c9a-b626-f8731255f8af","uuid":"b4d411a5-6fb8-4418-8d87-d16b3c6949f1","timestamp":"2026-10-26T05:28:39.088Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-th93fgmc/repo/README.md","content":"# Workspace tools\n\nA local workspace document service with title revisions, project membership and paginated browsing.\n\nThe public surface is the registry returned by the pyproject factory. Use the\nlocal credential fixtures for development. The host interface and operator\nboundaries are documented under docs/. All supplied examples are synthetic.\nTests describe intended local behavior; their presence does not establish that\nthey were executed. The imported supplier attachment is ordinary untrusted data.\n\nThe configured host_factory exposes local sessions, discovery, packet calls and\njournal queries. It shares one application registry across session handles. The\nregistry factory remains available for direct in-process